{"id":"07010","root":"uni07010_1","name":{"ja":"ワーウルフ","en":"Hairo Ichirota"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"ワーウルフ","en":"Hairo Ichirota"},"element":"Superhuman","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":[],"release":"2021-03-01","limited":true,"characterId":291,"profile":{"ja":"人狼と呼ばれる、屈強な肉体とパワーを持つ魔族。人間の姿に自在に変身する事ができ、人間の姿でいれば、一見してワーウルフであるとは分からない。オーガのようなパワーと、かすり傷ならすぐに癒えてしまう再生能力、鋼鉄も引き裂く鋭い爪と牙を有し、その目で睨まれると並の人間は麻痺して動けなくなる。さらに、満月の夜には能力が強化され、重傷を負ってもすぐに回復してしまうほどの強力な再生能力を得るとされている。熟練の対魔忍でない限り、満月の夜にワーウルフとの戦闘は避けるべきであろう。","en":"He is a demon known as a werewolf, with a sturdy physique and powerful abilities. He can transform into a human at will, and in his human form, it's not immediately apparent that he's a werewolf. He possesses the power of an ogre and the ability to quickly heal from minor injuries, as well as sharp claws and teeth that can tear through steel. His gaze can also paralyze a normal human. Furthermore, on full moon nights, his abilities are strengthened, and he gains a powerful regenerative ability that allows him to recover from even severe injuries. Unless you're an experienced Taimanin, it's best to avoid fighting a werewolf on a full moon night."},"illustrator":"羽山晃","voiceActor":"荒川虎鉄","forms":[{"id":"uni07010_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1226,2452],"sp":[170,170],"atk":[165,330],"def":[109,218],"spd":[83,83],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["1","990001"]},{"id":"uni07010_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1902,3804],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[261,522],"def":[149,298],"spd":[83,83],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["1","990001","990002"]},{"id":"uni07010_3","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","levelMax":100,"stats":{"hp":[2578,5152],"sp":[350,350],"atk":[359,720],"def":[191,381],"spd":[83,83],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["1","990001","990002","990003"]}],"skills":{"1":{"slot":"attack","id":1,"name":null,"hits":2,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"超人